{% extends "@Contao/content_element/_base.html.twig" %}

{#
    The mini basket (C10).

    Variables: line_count (int), total (formatted string), cart_page (string or
    null).

    The amount arrives formatted — MoneyFormatter did the rounding and the
    currency, not this file. There is deliberately no currency of its own to
    append: in English the symbol goes in front of the amount.

    line_count counts LINES, not pieces. See MiniCartController: a quantity is a
    decimal and would read as "2.5 articles", and it leaves out the lines that
    could not be priced — which are the ones a visitor has to act on.

    No link when there is no basket page. The finding in C-6 nags about that in
    the back end; a dead link would not help the visitor in the meantime.

    The element renders even when the basket is empty. One that disappeared
    would move the rest of the header the moment the first article goes in.
#}

{% block content %}
    <div class="consho-mini-cart{% if line_count == 0 %} consho-mini-cart--empty{% endif %}">
        {% if cart_page %}<a class="consho-mini-cart__link" href="{{ cart_page }}">{% endif %}
            <span class="invisible">{{ "CONSHO.miniCart.label"|trans({}, "contao_default") }}</span>
            <span class="consho-mini-cart__count">
                {{- line_count -}}
                <span class="invisible"> {{ "CONSHO.miniCart.lines"|trans({}, "contao_default") }}</span>
            </span>
            {#
                Net or gross is decided by the controller (C-4). The suffix is
                spelled out here for screen readers only: a mini cart has room for
                one number, but a number that does not say whether tax is included
                is no price indication.
            #}
            <span class="consho-mini-cart__total">
                {{- total -}}
                <span class="invisible"> {{ untaxed|default(false) ? ((shipped ?? true) ? "CONSHO.priceShippingOnly"|trans({}, "contao_default") : "") : ("CONSHO." ~ ((shipped ?? true) ? "priceTaxNotice" : "priceTaxOnly") ~ (showsNet|default(false) ? "Net" : ""))|trans({}, "contao_default") }}</span>
            </span>
        {% if cart_page %}</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}
